# What Docker never copies into an image build (the build context is the repository root)

# Secrets
.env
**/appsettings.*.local.json

# Build output, caches and dependencies (the images build their own)
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular

# Runtime data and local files
**/Logs
**/uploads
**/*.user
.vs
.git

# Not needed to build the API or the web app
docs
database
Veltrix.Tests
